# It's My Birthday — original story and translation by Claude (Anthropic).
# Target: HSK 3.0 level 1; focus grammar: dates (月, 号, 星期), 给, 了, 岁; names N.

@meta {"title_zh": "今天是我的生日", "subtitle_zh": "他们都忘了吗？", "title_en": "It's My Birthday", "subtitle_en": "Has everyone forgotten?", "author": "Text and translation by Claude (Anthropic)"}

